            "review_title": "Review at ROCK Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "Steveeee\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nRock Kitchen and Bar offers decent food at a fair price\nJan 2025 • Couples\nThe romantic vibe, highlighted by live violin music, sets the perfect mood for a date night.\nHowever, the service was a bit slow and staff could be more attentive.\nNice place overall, but there’s room for improvement.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 14, 2025",
